{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "\"Show in Finder\" in other apps opens Explorer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Afficher dans le Finder » dans les autres apps ouvre Explorer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%d items": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%d éléments"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 day": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 month": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 mois"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 week": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 semaine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A coloured disc on iCloud Drive and cloud storage items: online only, on this Mac, syncing, or a problem.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un disque coloré sur les éléments iCloud Drive et de stockage cloud : en ligne seulement, sur ce Mac, synchronisation, ou problème."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dialog shows what’s new and installs it when you say so.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une fenêtre présente les nouveautés et installe quand vous acceptez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A grey sign after the name: online only, syncing, or a problem; nothing for items already on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un signe gris après le nom : en ligne seulement, synchronisation, ou problème ; rien pour les éléments déjà sur ce Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short ⌘V still pastes. Keep ⌘ down and press V again to go down the list, then let go of ⌘ to paste. In the list, ⌘1 to ⌘9 paste the nine latest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un ⌘V court colle toujours. Maintenez ⌘ et appuyez à nouveau sur V pour descendre dans la liste, puis relâchez ⌘ pour coller. Dans la liste, ⌘1 à ⌘9 collent les neuf derniers éléments."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add App": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter une app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add folders from their right-click menu, or drop them among the Favorites in the sidebar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoutez des dossiers depuis leur menu contextuel, ou déposez-les parmi les Favoris de la barre latérale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After asking": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après confirmation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the name, as in Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après le nom, comme dans Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alias arrow in a white disc, as macOS 27": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Flèche d’alias dans un disque blanc, comme macOS 27"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aliases to folders count as folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les alias de dossiers comptent comme des dossiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Align icons to grid": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aligner les icônes sur la grille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisé"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also Cmd+Shift+period.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aussi Cmd+Maj+point."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also with the eye button in Explorer windows, or Cmd+Shift+period.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aussi avec le bouton œil dans les fenêtres Explorer, ou Cmd+Maj+point."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always, as in Windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours, comme sous Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An icon on the right of the menu bar, with New Explorer Window, the switch and Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une icône à droite de la barre des menus, avec Nouvelle fenêtre Explorer, le commutateur et Réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies while the desktop is sorted by type.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S'applique quand le bureau est trié par type."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps to ignore": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps à ignorer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrangement": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disposition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arrow keys go through the folder’s pictures; Open in Preview edits them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les touches fléchées parcourent les images du dossier ; Ouvrir dans Aperçu permet de les modifier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme le Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As Finder: as its Keep folders on top. Aliases to folders count as folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme le Finder : comme « Garder les dossiers en haut ». Les alias de dossiers comptent comme des dossiers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As Finder’s Sort By: icons follow the order chosen on the desktop and can’t be placed by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme « Trier par » du Finder : les icônes suivent l’ordre choisi sur le bureau et ne se placent pas à la main."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As Finder’s Use Stacks: inside each stack, items follow the sort order.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme « Utiliser les piles » du Finder : dans chaque pile, les éléments suivent l’ordre de tri."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As for the app": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme pour l'app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As macOS shows them": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme macOS les affiche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As macOS: as Finder’s Show all filename extensions. Never: “Report.pdf” shows as “Report”; renaming keeps the extension.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comme macOS : comme « Afficher toutes les extensions » du Finder. Jamais : « Rapport.pdf » s’affiche « Rapport » ; renommer garde l’extension."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask first": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demander d'abord"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At launch, and after a restart or a crash: each window where it was, its tabs, folders, Side by Side and preview pane. Windows you close don’t come back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Au lancement, et après un redémarrage ou un crash : chaque fenêtre à sa place, ses onglets, dossiers, Côte à côte et volet de prévisualisation. Les fenêtres fermées ne reviennent pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to the width new Explorer windows open at: %d points.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revenir à la largeur d'ouverture des nouvelles fenêtres Explorer : %d points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back up the history to iCloud Drive": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sauvegarder l'historique sur iCloud Drive"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bar replaces the system Dock, hidden with Finder’s icon, whose settings come back with the System Dock. Shown while Explorer manages files (General).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bar remplace le Dock système, masqué avec l'icône du Finder, dont les réglages reviennent avec le Dock système. Affiché quand Explorer gère les fichiers (Général)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Par défaut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Annuler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes made since loading it are kept in it only when you save.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modifications depuis le chargement ne sont conservées que lors de l'enregistrement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check Now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifier maintenant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check for updates automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rechercher les mises à jour automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose an App": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisir une app"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear History": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effacer l'historique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presse-papiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clipboard keeps what you copy, as Windows does. Hold ⌘V in any app to see the list, or use Edit › Clipboard History in Explorer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presse-papiers conserve ce que vous copiez, comme Windows. Maintenez ⌘V dans n'importe quelle app pour voir la liste, ou utilisez Édition › Historique du presse-papiers dans Explorer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clipboard pastes the item you choose into the app you were using.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presse-papiers colle l'élément choisi dans l'app que vous utilisiez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cloud storage: Google Drive, OneDrive and others": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stockage cloud : Google Drive, OneDrive et autres"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Create from Current Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Créer depuis les réglages actuels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current profile": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Profil actuel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current, ": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actuel, "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Desktop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bureau"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disques"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag a button out of the bar to hide it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faites glisser un bouton hors de la barre pour le masquer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag buttons to reorder them, into More, or out of the bar to hide them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faites glisser les boutons pour les réordonner, les mettre dans Plus, ou les sortir de la barre pour les masquer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop commands here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déposez des commandes ici"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each Mac keeps its own copy of the history in iCloud Drive › Explorer › Clipboard › %@. After reinstalling, or on a new Mac, turning this on brings the history back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque Mac conserve sa propre copie de l'historique dans iCloud Drive › Explorer › Clipboard › %@. Après une réinstallation, ou sur un nouveau Mac, activer ceci restaure l'historique."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empty Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vider la Corbeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Empty, Explorer looks at the latest release on GitHub, where scripts/publish.sh publishes them. A web address of another update.json works too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vide, Explorer consulte la dernière publication GitHub, où scripts/publish.sh les publie. Une adresse web d'un autre update.json fonctionne aussi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erases everything in these folders for good, after asking. It can’t be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Efface définitivement tout ce qui se trouve dans ces dossiers, après confirmation. Irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every button in the toolbar, in the usual order, icons only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les boutons dans la barre, dans l'ordre habituel, icônes seulement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suite Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suite Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explorer and Suite Settings restart to apply the change.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Explorer et Suite Settings redémarrent pour appliquer la modification."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "F2 or Return renames; Cmd+Down or a double-click opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F2 ou Entrée renomme ; Cmd+Bas ou un double-clic ouvre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "F2 renames; Return, Cmd+Down or a double-click opens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "F2 renomme ; Entrée, Cmd+Bas ou un double-clic ouvre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Favorites": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Favoris"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "File extensions": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extensions des fichiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder Tree": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arborescence"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folders first": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossiers en premier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folders first in windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossiers en premier dans les fenêtres"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forget items after": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oublier les éléments après"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Général"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub releases": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Publications GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grid spacing": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Espacement de la grille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masqué"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden folders (starting with a dot) appear at the end of the list when typing a path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les dossiers cachés (commençant par un point) apparaissent en fin de liste quand on tape un chemin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hidden, it slides in when the pointer reaches the bottom of the screen. On screen, maximized windows end above it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masqué, il glisse en bas de l'écran quand le pointeur l'atteint. À l'écran, les fenêtres agrandies s'arrêtent au-dessus de lui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se masque automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hides automatically with these apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se masque automatiquement avec ces apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "History": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Historique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold ⌘V to open the history": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenir ⌘V pour ouvrir l'historique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding ⌘V and pasting into the app you were using need Accessibility access for Clipboard. Until then, the item you choose is copied: press ⌘V to paste it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maintenir ⌘V et coller dans l'app utilisée nécessite l'accès Accessibilité pour Presse-papiers. En attendant, l'élément choisi est copié : appuyez sur ⌘V pour le coller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icons": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icônes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icons and names": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icônes et noms"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Icons can’t be placed by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
