            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les deux dossiers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show thumbnails instead of icons": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les aperçus à la place des icônes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show where icons will land while dragging": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher la cible lors du déplacement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows or hides the folder tree. It stays first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affiche ou masque l'arborescence. Elle reste en première position."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows or hides the sidebar. It stays first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affiche ou masque la barre latérale. Il reste en premier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Side by Side": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Côte à côte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sidebar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barre latérale"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Size": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Petit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some of its settings take effect when Explorer opens again. Everything else is already applied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certains réglages prennent effet à la prochaine ouverture d'Explorer. Tout le reste est déjà appliqué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stack folders and aliases together": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regrouper dossiers et alias dans une pile"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stack only while sorted by type": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Piles seulement quand le bureau est trié par type"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stacks": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Piles"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stays on screen": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reste à l'écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stays on screen with these apps": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reste à l'écran avec ces apps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching back to Finder brings back its desktop and windows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revenir à Finder restaure son bureau et ses fenêtres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Dock": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dock système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Langue du système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onglets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Side by Side button opens a second window, each on half of the screen. F5 copies and F6 moves the selected items to the other side; the arrows button swaps the sides. Click the button again to close the second window.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bouton Côte à côte ouvre une seconde fenêtre, chacune sur la moitié de l'écran. F5 copie et F6 déplace les éléments sélectionnés de l'autre côté ; le bouton avec les flèches permute les côtés. Cliquez à nouveau sur le bouton pour fermer la seconde fenêtre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Side by Side button splits the window in two; the second folder starts on the next tab’s folder, or the same one. F5 copies and F6 moves the selected items to the other side; the arrows button swaps the sides. Click the button again to close it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bouton Côte à côte divise la fenêtre en deux ; le second dossier commence sur le dossier de l'onglet suivant, ou le même. F5 copie et F6 déplace les éléments sélectionnés de l'autre côté ; le bouton avec les flèches permute les côtés. Cliquez à nouveau sur le bouton pour le fermer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The buttons the window is too narrow for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les boutons que la fenêtre est trop étroite pour afficher."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The buttons, their order, More’s menu, the hidden ones and the labels go back as they were there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les boutons, leur ordre, le menu Plus, les masqués et les libellés reviennent tels qu'ils étaient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The latest %d": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les %d derniers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profile couldn’t be saved or read": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le profil n'a pas pu être enregistré ou lu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidebar button hides or shows it; right-click the sidebar to choose icons only. Side by Side, the right folder’s sidebar has its own button and its own setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bouton de la barre latérale la masque ou l’affiche ; un clic droit dessus permet de n’afficher que les icônes. Côte à côte, la barre latérale du dossier de droite a son propre bouton et son propre réglage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidebar button hides or shows it; right-click the tree to choose icons only. Side by Side, the right folder’s tree has its own button and its own setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bouton de la barre latérale la masque ou l'affiche ; clic droit sur l'arborescence pour choisir icônes seulement. En Côte à côte, l'arborescence du dossier droit a son propre bouton et son propre réglage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The toolbar as the profile “%@” holds it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La barre d'outils telle que le profil « %@ » la contient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The toolbar of “%@”": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "la barre d'outils du profil « %@ »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The toolbar’s first buttons": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "les boutons par défaut de la barre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They come last.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ils viennent en dernier."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text size": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Taille du texte"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tight": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Serré"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To keep them above Bar and show the minimized ones in it, Bar needs the Accessibility permission (Privacy & Security › Accessibility).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour les maintenir au-dessus de Bar et afficher les fenêtres réduites dedans, Bar a besoin de l'autorisation Accessibilité (Confidentialité et sécurité › Accessibilité)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toolbar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Barre d'outils"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top left, as Windows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En haut à gauche, comme Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top right, as Finder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En haut à droite, comme le Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trash": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corbeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn Clipboard on in System Settings › General › Login Items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez Presse-papiers dans Réglages Système › Général › Ouverture au démarrage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpin": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désépingler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use tabs": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utiliser les onglets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What is copied in these apps is not kept. Passwords that password managers mark as private are never kept, whatever the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui est copié dans ces apps n'est pas conservé. Les mots de passe que les gestionnaires de mots de passe marquent comme privés ne sont jamais conservés, quelle que soit l'app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the Trash shows": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contenu de la Corbeille"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What was deleted from iCloud Drive, and from the Desktop and Documents when they are in iCloud, shows in the Trash: it can be restored or deleted permanently.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui a été supprimé d'iCloud Drive, et du Bureau et des Documents s'ils sont dans iCloud, apparaît dans la Corbeille : il peut être restauré ou supprimé définitivement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the desktop is full. Otherwise those items are hidden.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand le bureau est plein. Sinon ces éléments sont masqués."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While an app fills the screen. As for the app: the default and the lists above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand une app occupe tout l'écran. Comme pour l'app : le réglage par défaut et les listes ci-dessus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While one of them is in front. Each default keeps its own list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand l'une d'elles est au premier plan. Chaque réglage par défaut garde sa propre liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wide": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Large"
          }
        }
